=== tty-set-echoing-returns-previous
tags: rl_tty_set_echoing
--- script
rl_initialize
rl_tty_set_echoing 0
rl_tty_set_echoing 0
rl_tty_set_echoing 5
rl_tty_set_echoing 1

=== tty-set-echoing-during-readline
tags: rl_tty_set_echoing
--- script
def b
rl_tty_set_echoing 0
end
defun t b
rl_bind_keyseq "\C-xt" t
readline "> "
readline "> "
--- keys
ab\C-xtc\rxyz\r

=== prep-deprep-from-command
tags: rl_prep_terminal rl_deprep_terminal
--- script
def b
rl_deprep_terminal
get rl_readline_state
rl_prep_terminal 1
get rl_readline_state
end
defun t b
rl_bind_keyseq "\C-xt" t
readline "> "
--- keys
ab\C-xtc\r

=== prep-terminal-twice
tags: rl_prep_terminal rl_deprep_terminal
--- script
rl_initialize
rl_prep_terminal 0
rl_prep_terminal 0
get rl_readline_state
rl_deprep_terminal
get rl_readline_state
readline "> "
--- keys
ok\r

